sequenceDiagram
    participant User as End User
    participant KS as KServe Controller
    participant CSI as Storage CSI (MinIO)
    participant VLLM as vLLM Predictor Pod
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant HPA as K8s HPA

    User->>KS: Deploy InferenceService (Llama-3-70B)
    KS->>CP: Spin up Predictor Pod
    CP->>CSI: Request Model Weights
    CSI-->>VLLM: Stream 140GB weights from Cold Storage
    VLLM->>VLLM: Load weights into GPU VRAM (PagedAttention)
    VLLM-->>KS: Ready
    User->>VLLM: API Request (OpenAI schema)
    VLLM-->>User: Streaming response
    Prom->>VLLM: Scrape metrics (Concurrent Requests > Threshold)
    Prom->>HPA: Trigger Scale Up
    HPA->>KS: Replicas = 2
    Note over KS, VLLM: New Pod spun up on second GPU
